# This repo's own ignore rules. `templates/gitignore` is the canonical list shipped to
# consumer repos - keep the system entries below in step with it. Deliberately not
# managed by `callum-dev update`: dev-system is the source of the template, not a
# consumer of it, so there is no stamp or baseline here to merge against.

# This system's own tooling. dev-system is subject to these like any other repo -
# templates/treehouse.toml ships root = "./", so worktrees land inside the repo.
.treehouse/
.no-mistakes/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json

# Node.
node_modules/

# npm pack output, from verifying that templates/gitignore really is packaged
# (npm drops any file literally named .gitignore - see the note in bin/callum-dev.js).
*.tgz

# Logs.
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# OS and editor cruft.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
